      "id": "session:2026-10-12-a38a03e6",
      "type": "Session",
      "label": "Extractors, renderers, agent guide and MVP validation",
      "description": "Goal: Finish the MVP: #6 to #12 and #28.\nInstructions: One issue, one branch, one PR; the user merges. Credit the authors of example repos.\nDiscoveries: The basic-python-cli render mixed Spanish and English labels; the user wants zoom, node details on click, and a way to delete or edit nodes; the HTML of a 376-node graph takes seconds to lay out; two candidate example repos declare no license.\nAccomplished: Python extractor (#24), dependencies and config (#25), pytest tests (#26), static render with --dpi (#27), kg remove and kg edit (#29), interactive HTML (#30), kg guide (#31), MVP validated on three MIT repos with published examples (#32), prototypes removed (#34). GitHub Pages enabled by hand by the user. Issues #35 to #40 opened for v0.2.\nNext steps: v0.2: #35 to #40. An external suggestion asks for a reproducible benchmark, code against graph.\nRelevant files: src/kg/extract/, src/kg/render/, src/kg/agents/guide.md, docs/mvp-validation.md, docs/examples/",
